      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Engagement read-back (every 6 h)\nSettles natively-scheduled posts whose time has passed, then stores a reactions / clicks / views snapshot (insights, pages_read_engagement), plus comments / shares when the token also has pages_read_user_content, next to each live post (last 30 days). Dry-run posts are skipped: there is nothing real to read.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0cea7622-6ad0-43a4-a8b4-4fc5c81ae01f",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -60
      ]
    },
